                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=p0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">为进一步加强全国青少年毒品预防教育工作，有效遏制毒品滥用问题在青少年群体中发展蔓延，国家禁毒委员会办公室、教育部和共青团中央按照全国青少年毒品预防教育</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>“6.27”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">工程规划，决定举办全国青少年禁毒知识竞赛活动。现将有关事项通知如下：</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 68pt" class=p19><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">一、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">组织领导</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=p0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">竞赛活动由国家禁毒委员会办公室、教育部、团中央主办，中国禁毒基金会承办。为确保竞赛活动的顺利进行，成立全国青少年禁毒知识竞赛活动办公室，国家禁毒办常务副主任、公安部禁毒局局长胡明朗任办公室主任，教育部基础教育一司、团中央维护青少年权益部、中国禁毒基金会相关负责人为副主任，国家禁毒办副主任、中国禁毒基金会秘书长李宪辉负责办公室日常工作。</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 68pt" class=p19><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">二、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">参赛范围</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; BACKGROUND: white" class=p18><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">竞赛活动参赛人员为全国在校初中生、高中生、职业技术学校学生。</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 68pt" class=p19><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">三、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">竞赛内容</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=p0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">竞赛活动涉及内容包括我国禁毒工作方针政策、禁毒法律法规、禁毒历史、毒品知识、毒品危害、防毒技巧、毒情形势、国际相关禁毒公约以及青少年毒品预防教育</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>“6.27”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">工程等。</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 68pt" class=p19><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">四、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">奖项设置</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=p0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">竞赛活动设一等奖</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">名，奖励</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>20000</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">元人民币，颁发证书；二等奖</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">名，各奖励</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>10000</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">元人民币，颁发证书；三等奖</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">名，各奖励</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>5000</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">元人民币，颁发证书；优秀组织奖</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>5</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">名，各奖励</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>10000</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">元人民币，颁发证书；纪念奖</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>500</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">名，各奖励</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>100</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">元手机流量包。</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=p0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">五、时间安排</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=p0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">竞赛活动自</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>2016</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">年</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>9</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">月</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">日至</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>2016</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">年</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>10</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">月</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>30</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">日，分为初赛和决赛两个阶段。</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=p0><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">初赛：（</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>9</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">月</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">日至</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>9</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">月</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>30</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">日）。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">全国参赛学生登录</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">中国禁毒</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">微信（微信号：</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>onncc626</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">）、中国禁毒网（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>www.nncc626.com</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">）、中国禁毒数字展览馆（</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>www.626china.org</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">）。在线答题过程中会抽取</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>100</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">名幸运同学，颁发奖品。各省、自治区、直辖市禁毒办在获得满分的学生中组织</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">个队参加决赛。每个参赛队由初中生、高中生、职业技校学生各</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">名组成。</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.25pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=p0><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">决赛：（</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>10</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">月</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>15</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">日、</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>16</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">日）。</SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">决赛在北京举行，通过</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">绝对挑战</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">、</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">以一敌百</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">等项目挑战方式决出一、二、三等奖，并由中央电视台少儿频道录制播出。</SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.25pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=p0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"><FONT color=#ee1111 size=5><STRONG>提醒：全体同学望积极参与此项活动。</STRONG></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 28.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.25pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=p0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"></SPAN> </P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial"></SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 30pt; TEXT-INDENT: -216pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 216pt; mso-char-indent-count: -13.5" class=p0><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">国家禁毒委员会办公室<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>教 育<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>部<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>共 青 团 中央<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">                                                                               </SPAN></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>2016</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">年</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>8</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">月</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt" lang=EN-US>22</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial">日</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P></o:p></SPAN>
    
